  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Santhosh Boban vs The Administrator on 12 April, 2024 Author: P Gopinath Bench: P Gopinath In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice Gopinath P. Friday, the 12th day of April 2024 / 23rd Chaithra, 1946 Wp(C) No. 9605 Of 2012(A) Petitioners: 1. Santhosh Boban, S/O. V. Narayanankutty Menon, Municipal Councilor, Unnayi Warrier Ward-Xxvi, Irinjalakuda.P.O 680 121,Thrissur Dt 2. Raji Suresh Municipal Councilor, Sree Koodalmanickam Ward- Xxv, Irinjalakuda.P.O 680 121,Thrissur Dt Respondents: 1. The Administrator, Sree Koodalmanickom Devaswom Managing Committee, Irinjalakuda.P.O 680 121, Thrissur Dt 2. State Of Kerala Represented By Principal Secretary, Department Of Devaswom, Secretariat, Thiruvananthapuram - 695 001. 3. The District Collector, Civil Station, Thrissur 680 001. 4. The Chief Wildlife Warden, Forest & Wild Life Department, Thiruvananthapuram - 695 001. Writ petition (civil) praying inter alia that in the circumstances stated in the affidavit filed along with the WP(C) the High Court be pleased to direct the respondents to take immediate and effective steps to provide for the safety and healthy custody of the animal and prevent loss of damage to people and property, pending disposal of the WP.",
